      "title": "After Work, We'll Have Each Other",
      "gist": "If AI ends work, life turns relational, and history suggests that means small, clannish, conformist worlds, so keep work's impersonal respect.",
      "question": "Relational society — why would a world without work leave us worse off than the one we have?"
    },
